of DNA</article-title><source>Mol. Cell</source><year>2000</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>1025</fpage><lpage>1035</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11106742</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ramos</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Ghosh</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Baxter</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Corces</surname><given-names>VG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genomic organization of gypsy chromatin insulators in Drosophila melanogaster</article-title><source>Genetics</source><year>2006</year><volume>172</volume><fpage>2337</fpage><lpage>2349</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16452134</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Parnell</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuhn</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Gilmore</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Helou</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Wold</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Geyer</surname><given-names>PK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Identification of genomic sites that bind the <italic>Drosophila</italic> suppressor of Hairy-wing insulator protein</article-title><source>Mol. Cell. Biol.</source><year>2006</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>5983</fpage><lpage>5993</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16880510</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mihaly</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Hogga</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Barges</surname><given-name